   355	  INCOMPLETE — every other missing or failed registered item does). Every run's JSON carries
   356	  `headline_eligible` with machine-readable reasons; a headline per (arm ×
   357	  operating point) requires three complete eligible restarts with the same
   358	  effective variant (capture scope / adapter / compile mode), else the cell
   359	  is `INCOMPLETE`. At the end of each session `fullmodel/completeness.py`
   360	  audits the registered mandatory items BY CONTENT — session 1: the 21
   361	  matrix cells, the three matched-pair families (m1–m3), the once-only
   362	  (C1, C1A) attempt's terminal record, both planted-fault records (FAIL at
